From: "Fable (Claude)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:26:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: UI/content refinements (Latin name, no language levels,
 dark default)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Visible name spelled "Mustafa Kelesoglu" everywhere (UI, metadata,
  JSON-LD, manifest, regenerated share images)
- Language listings without C1/B2 levels: Deutsch · Englisch · Türkçe
- Evidence strip as descriptive cards, no oversized numerals
- Hero fact-sheet label column fixed so "Schwerpunkte" never breaks
- Language switcher stays on one row on desktop and mobile
- Dark mode is the initial theme; toggle to light kept and persisted
- Tests for the refinements (44 passing)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01L7CFpCTFxknYUWrmiHgkHf
